          answer: 'BC = 15 cm; Area = 60 cm².',
          explanation: 'BC² = AC² − AB² = 17² − 8² = 289 − 64 = 225, so BC = 15 cm. Area = ½ × AB × BC = ½ × 8 × 15 = 60 cm².',
